        "title": "Here’s what’s new with iOS and macOS 27 beta 6",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/17/heres-whats-new-with-ios-27-beta-6/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/ios-27-orange.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple released iOS 27 beta 6 today, giving developer beta testers the next preview update since iOS 27 debuted at WWDC. Developer beta testers can download the new beta now.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27 is a major iPhone update centered around Siri AI, Apple Intelligence, Liquid Glass refinements, and a long list of quality-of-life changes. Here’s what we’ve found so far in iOS 27 beta 6.</p>",
