        "title": "ChatGPT subscribers can now open and edit Google Drive files from inside the chat",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/14/chatgpt-subscribers-can-now-open-and-edit-google-drive-files-from-inside-the-chat/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/chatgpt-googledive.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1500\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">ChatGPT is rolling out a deeper integration with Google Drive, allowing users to add Google Drive files to their ChatGPT Library and edit documents without leaving the chat. Here are the details.</p>",
