        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/app-store.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has submitted its proposal for the fees it should be allowed to charge for purchases made outside of the App Store system in the <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/epic-games/\">Epic Games case</a>. Here are the details.</p>",
