        "title": "What’s an Orchestrator—and Why Does Software Need One?",
        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/whats-an-orchestrator-and-why-does-software-need-one/",
        "content_text": "The following article originally appeared on Medium and is being republished here with the author’s permission. Everybody’s talking about the death of developers. I get it. The developer whose job was to write boilerplate or scaffold CRUD apps is done—a model can do that in seconds, and that developer is not coming back. But the [&#8230;]",
