        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/the-two-pillars-of-post-training-reinforcement-learning-and-supervised-fine-tuning/",
        "content_text": "This is the second article in Sharon Zhou’s post-training series. Read part 1 here. In the first post of this series, you learned how post-training closed the fundamental gap in usability of LLMs by making them behave in a certain way. In this post, you’ll explore specific techniques you can use to change a model’s [&#8230;]",
