        "title": "Peacock is the latest streaming service to increase prices, details here",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/18/peacock-is-the-latest-streaming-service-to-increase-prices-details-here/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2022/04/peacock.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Another streaming service is getting more expensive. Peacock has raised the prices of all three subscription tiers, with increases of up to $3 per month or $30 per year.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Peacock’s latest increase makes Premium Plus a $20 monthly subscription. However, Apple’s discounted bundles appear to remain unchanged for now.</p>",
        "type": "Technology",
        "source": "9to5Mac"
