        "title": "iPhone 18 Pro Max vs Pro: Here’s how Apple will differentiate models",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/14/iphone-18-pro-max-vs-pro-heres-how-apple-will-differentiate-models/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/iphone-18-pro-mockup.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPhone 18 Pro will be <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/21/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-new-model-is-coming/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1048598\">unveiled soon</a>, and rumors indicate the Pro Max model could have unique advantages this year in a key area or two. Here’s what to expect.</p>",
