        "title": "Apple takes down billboard after accusations of normalizing ‘electronic babysitting’",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/14/apple-takes-down-billboard-after-accusations-of-normalizing-electronic-babysitting/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/apple-logo-milan-store.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1500\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has replaced a billboard in Milan that showed a toddler holding an iPhone, as part of its newest “Relax, it’s iPhone” campaign. Here are the details.</p>",
